  "benefits_features_and_faqs": {
    "about_overview": "With an annual fee of Rs. 499 – compensated for in the first year by 499 bonus NeuCoins and waived from second year onwards on Rs. 1 Lakh annual spends – the Plus variant can be an ideal choice for beginners seeking multi-brand benefits at low fee. However, it is important to consider that earning as well as redemption options are limited to brands within the Tata Neu ecosystem. Hence, consumers who frequently shop with the associated brands can make the most of its benefits.",
